{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51443","headline":"寄郑碏叠石砚歌 · 庄南杰","name":"寄郑碏叠石砚歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娲皇补天残锦片，飞落人间爲石砚。\n孤峯削叠一尺云，虎干熊跪势皆徧。\n半掬走泉澄浅清，洞天彻底寒泓泓。\n笔头抢起松烟轻，龙蛇怒閗秋云生。\n我今得此以代耕，如探禹穴披峥嵘。\n披峥嵘，心骨惊，坐中髣髴到蓬瀛。\n（《文房四谱》三《砚谱》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}